    "description": "The Satisfaction with Love Life Scale (SWLLS) is a 5-item self-report questionnaire measuring global cognitive satisfaction with one's romantic relationship and love life. It is used in well-being and relationship research as a brief domain-specific complement to broader life satisfaction measures.",
